XXLO VR XLO/ap1 XLO/an1 XLO/ap3 XLO/an3 XSUB/A XSUB/B XLO/ap4 XLO/an4 LOIP LOIN LOQN
+ LOQP VSS lo_comb
XXSUB VR XSUB/A XSUB/B XSUB/Y VSS nor2
XXCVR VR VSS vco_ring4_CVR
